prompt.output_format:
Return ONLY a valid JSON object. No explanation. No markdown. No extra text. Exactly these 5 keys:
{ "step_therapy_text": "...", "num_steps_brands": "...", "num_steps_generic": "...", "step_phototherapy": "...", "_reasoning": "One sentence: which section/rule drove your step count, or why you returned NA (e.g. '{brand} is in the Preferred Products list on page 2 — no step therapy applies')." }
Return ONLY a valid JSON object. Do NOT wrap your response in markdown code blocks. Do NOT use backticks. Do NOT prefix with ```json or any other text. Your entire response must start with { and end with }.

prompt.document:
Brand: {brand}
Generic names: {generics_list}

Policy document (filtered pages — step therapy context for {brand}):
{document_text}
